### Get Customers for Tenant A (Company 1)
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/customers
Accept: application/json

### Get Customers for Tenant B (Company 2)
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/2/customers
Accept: application/json


### 1. Stock In / Adjust Stock on Tenant A (Company 1)
POST {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/inventory/adjust?productId=1&quantity=50.00&reorderLevel=10.00
Accept: application/json

### 2. View Inventory Status on Tenant A
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/inventory
Accept: application/json

### 3. Process Sale for Tenant A (Deducts 5 units)
POST {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-001",
  "customerId": 1,
  "saleItems": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 5.00,
      "unitPrice": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Verify Auto Stock Reduction on Tenant A (Remaining stock should be 45.00)
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/inventory
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch Analytics Report for Tenant A
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/reports/sales-summary
Accept: application/json

### 6. Fetch Analytics Report for Tenant B (Proves Tenant 2 remains untouched)
GET {{HardwareManagement.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/2/reports/sales-summary
Accept: application/json